#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course explores the tools being used in the pursuit of quantum "
"advantage, including quantum error suppression, mitigation, detection, and "
"correction. Each method is explained in theory, and then put into practice "
"using Qiskit. We discuss which method is useful in which scenarios, as well "
"as general trends in applicability. As the course progresses, we pay "
"particular attention to which tools can be leveraged together, and which "
"conflict.\n"
msgstr ""

